		{
			dependencies: ["62BE7F6DB1645F9E"]
			description: [
				"Relics are &efound, not made&f: each one has a small chance to be lying in the right kind of loot chest - ocean ruins for the swimmer's gear, the Nether for the fiery ones, End cities for the strangest. Every quest here says where to look."
				"Each relic has abilities that &elevel up&f as you use it. Hold Shift on a relic and click to open its page, spend its points and reroll what you do not like."
				"This page is a collection. There is no order and no need to find them all: any ten finish it."
			]
